# 25. WebSocket Rule

Agents WebSocket must have:

- One client instance
- Correct cleanup
- Bounded reconnects
- Exponential backoff
- Stable state
- Manual retry in degraded mode
- No reconnect spam
- No flashing warning
- No duplicate subscriptions
- No JWT in logs
- No authenticated URL in console
- REST fallback where appropriate

If unavailable:

- Show one stable degraded message
- Keep the page usable
- Do not show fake real-time status

